<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Doctor Application Update - PH Healthcare</title>
</head>

<body style="
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    background-color:#f4f7fb;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
">
    <div style="padding:40px 20px;">
        <div style="
            max-width:600px;
            margin:0 auto;
            background:#ffffff;
            border-radius:12px;
            overflow:hidden;
            box-shadow:0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        ">

```
        <!-- Header -->
        <div style="
            padding:28px 32px;
            background:#0f766e;
            text-align:center;
        ">
            <h1 style="
                margin:0;
                color:#ffffff;
                font-size:24px;
                font-weight:700;
            ">
                PH Healthcare
            </h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div style="padding:35px 32px;">

            <h2 style="
                margin:0 0 16px;
                color:#1f2937;
                font-size:22px;
                font-weight:600;
            ">
                Doctor Application Update
            </h2>

            <p style="
                margin:0 0 20px;
                color:#4b5563;
                font-size:15px;
                line-height:1.6;
            ">
                Dear <strong><%= doctorName %></strong>,
            </p>

            <p style="
                margin:0 0 20px;
                color:#4b5563;
                font-size:15px;
                line-height:1.6;
            ">
                Thank you for your interest in joining PH Healthcare.
                After carefully reviewing your doctor application,
                we are unable to approve your application at this time.
            </p>

            <!-- Rejection Status -->
            <div style="
                margin:28px 0;
                padding:22px;
                background:#fef2f2;
                border:1px solid #fecaca;
                border-radius:8px;
                text-align:center;
            ">
                <p style="
                    margin:0 0 10px;
                    color:#64748b;
                    font-size:13px;
                ">
                    Application Status
                </p>

                <div style="
                    font-size:24px;
                    font-weight:700;
                    color:#dc2626;
                ">
                    REJECTED
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Rejection Reason -->
            <% if (rejectionReason) { %>
                <div style="
                    margin:24px 0;
                    padding:16px;
                    background:#fff7ed;
                    border-left:4px solid #f97316;
                    border-radius:4px;
                ">
                    <p style="
                        margin:0 0 8px;
                        color:#9a3412;
                        font-size:13px;
                        font-weight:700;
                    ">
                        Reason for rejection
                    </p>

                    <p style="
                        margin:0;
                        color:#4b5563;
                        font-size:14px;
                        line-height:1.6;
                    ">
                        <%= rejectionReason %>
                    </p>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <p style="
                margin:0 0 12px;
                color:#4b5563;
                font-size:14px;
                line-height:1.6;
            ">
                We encourage you to review the information provided
                in your application and make any necessary corrections.
            </p>

            <p style="
                margin:0;
                color:#4b5563;
                font-size:14px;
                line-height:1.6;
            ">
                You may submit a new application in the future if
                you meet the required criteria.
            </p>

            <!-- Notice -->
            <div style="
                margin-top:24px;
                padding:14px 16px;
                background:#f8fafc;
                border-left:4px solid #64748b;
                border-radius:4px;
            ">
                <p style="
                    margin:0;
                    color:#475569;
                    font-size:13px;
                    line-height:1.5;
                ">
                    <strong>Need help?</strong>
                    Please contact the PH Healthcare support team
                    if you believe this decision was made in error.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Closing -->
            <p style="
                margin:30px 0 0;
                color:#6b7280;
                font-size:14px;
                line-height:1.6;
            ">
                Thank you for your understanding.<br><br>

                Regards,<br>

                <strong style="color:#374151;">
                    PH Healthcare Team
                </strong>
            </p>

        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div style="
            padding:20px 32px;
            background:#f8fafc;
            text-align:center;
        ">
            <p style="
                margin:0;
                color:#94a3b8;
                font-size:12px;
            ">
                © <%= year %> PH Healthcare. All rights reserved.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
```

</body>
</html>
